, the demand for advanced materials like alumina fibers has surged. At Vulcan Shield Global (VSG), we specialise in the research, development and production of both alumina long fibers and alumina short fibers, offering tailored thermal and mechanical solutions for a wide range of sectors including aerospace, energy, petrochemicals, automotive, electronics, and advanced manufacturing.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d17ba21 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"d17ba21\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3ab9457 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"3ab9457\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.19.0 - 28-02-2024 *\/\n.elementor-heading-title{padding:0;margin:0;line-height:1}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title[class*=elementor-size-]>a{color:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-small{font-size:15px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-medium{font-size:19px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-large{font-size:29px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xl{font-size:39px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xxl{font-size:59px}<\/style><h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><h2 data-start=\"781\" data-end=\"808\">What Are Alumina Fibers?<br><\/h2><p data-start=\"810\" data-end=\"1064\"><\/p><\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-36cc94e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"36cc94e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Alumina fibers are ceramic fibers primarily composed of aluminium oxide (Al\u2082O\u2083), known for their exceptional thermal resistance, mechanical strength, and chemical stability. These fibers are typically classified into two types:<\/p><ul type=\"disc\"><li>Alumina Long Fibers (Continuous Fibers)<\/li><li>Alumina Short Fibers (Discontinuous Fibers)<\/li><\/ul><p>Both offer unique performance benefits and are engineered to meet the demands of extreme operating conditions.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d982779 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"d982779\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ab465c3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"ab465c3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><h2 data-start=\"781\" data-end=\"808\">Alumina Long Fibers: Strength, Structure & Composite Reinforcement\n<br><\/h2><p data-start=\"810\" data-end=\"1064\"><\/p><\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6e63203 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"6e63203\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.19.0 - 28-02-2024 *\/\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}<\/style>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" src=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Alumina-Fiber-1024x768.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-1406\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Alumina-Fiber-1024x768.png 1024w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Alumina-Fiber-300x225.png 300w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Alumina-Fiber-768x576.png 768w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Alumina-Fiber.png 1440w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-48ee549 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"48ee549\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Our alumina long fibers come in 4 main series, M-99, C-85, F-72 and our newest addition, B-70. These are continuous fibers produced using the internationally recognised sol-gel method, ideal for reinforcing composites used in high-temperature structural applications. We are able to weave our alumina long fibers into various forms like woven fabric, woven tape, braided sleeves, sewing thread, braided rope etc. The individual fibers can also be used in ceramic matrix composite (CMC) applications.<\/p><h3 data-start=\"1607\" data-end=\"1624\" class=\"\">Key Benefits:<\/h3><ul data-start=\"1625\" data-end=\"2028\"><li data-start=\"1625\" data-end=\"1723\" class=\"\"><p data-start=\"1627\" data-end=\"1723\" class=\"\">High Strength &amp; Modulus: Maintains structural integrity under thermal and mechanical stress.<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"1724\" data-end=\"1825\" class=\"\"><p data-start=\"1726\" data-end=\"1825\" class=\"\">Extreme Temperature Resistance: Continuous use up to 1300\u00b0C, with peak resistance up to 1600\u00b0C.<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"1826\" data-end=\"1941\" class=\"\"><p data-start=\"1828\" data-end=\"1941\" class=\"\">Versatile Matrix Compatibility: Suitable for polymer, ceramic, and metal matrix composites (MMC).<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"1942\" data-end=\"2028\" class=\"\"><p data-start=\"1944\" data-end=\"2028\" class=\"\">Flexible Textiles: Can be woven into fabrics, tapes, braided sleeves, ropes and sewing thread.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h3 data-start=\"2030\" data-end=\"2056\"><\/h3><h3 data-start=\"2030\" data-end=\"2056\" class=\"\">Industry Applications:<\/h3><ul data-start=\"2057\" data-end=\"2391\"><li data-start=\"2057\" data-end=\"2144\" class=\"\"><p data-start=\"2059\" data-end=\"2144\" class=\"\">Aerospace: Structural composite reinforcement, ablative layers, insulation wraps.<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"2216\" data-end=\"2307\" class=\"\"><p data-start=\"2218\" data-end=\"2307\" class=\"\">Electronics: Mobile phone backplane reinforcement, thermally stable insulation films.<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"2308\" data-end=\"2391\" class=\"\"><p data-start=\"2310\" data-end=\"2391\" class=\"\">Automotive &amp; EVs: High-strength lightweight components for electric vehicles.<\/p><\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4d66293 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"4d66293\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cc9de27 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"cc9de27\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><h2 data-start=\"781\" data-end=\"808\">Alumina Short Fibers: Thermal Insulation & Lightweight Protection\n\n<br><\/h2><p data-start=\"810\" data-end=\"1064\"><\/p><\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4df52ee elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"4df52ee\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"459\" src=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Alumina-Fiber-Needled-Blanket-1024x734.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-1571\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Alumina-Fiber-Needled-Blanket-1024x734.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Alumina-Fiber-Needled-Blanket-300x215.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Alumina-Fiber-Needled-Blanket-768x551.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Alumina-Fiber-Needled-Blanket-1536x1101.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Alumina-Fiber-Needled-Blanket-2048x1468.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6917a1d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6917a1d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"2468\" data-end=\"2651\" class=\"\">Alumina short fibers, such as our M-F-72 bulk fiber, N-F-1600 Needled Blankets and FP-F-72 Fiber Paper provide exceptional insulation and thermal protection while being light weight and easily moulded to suit different applications.<\/p><h3 data-start=\"2653\" data-end=\"2670\" class=\"\">Key Benefits:<\/h3><ul data-start=\"2671\" data-end=\"3025\"><li data-start=\"2671\" data-end=\"2755\" class=\"\"><p data-start=\"2673\" data-end=\"2755\" class=\"\">Low Thermal Conductivity: Superior heat retention and energy efficiency.<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"2756\" data-end=\"2855\" class=\"\"><p data-start=\"2758\" data-end=\"2855\" class=\"\">High-Temperature Capability: Continuous use temperature rating to 1500\u00b0C.<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"2856\" data-end=\"2927\" class=\"\"><p data-start=\"2858\" data-end=\"2927\" class=\"\">Lightweight &amp; Resilient: Ideal for weight-sensitive applications.<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"2928\" data-end=\"3025\" class=\"\"><p data-start=\"2930\" data-end=\"3025\" class=\"\">Non-Hazardous &amp; Chemically Stable: Resistant to acids, alkalis, and oxidising environments.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h3 data-start=\"3027\" data-end=\"3053\"><\/h3><h3 data-start=\"3027\" data-end=\"3053\" class=\"\">Industry Applications:<\/h3><ul data-start=\"3054\" data-end=\"3419\"><li data-start=\"3054\" data-end=\"3141\" class=\"\"><p data-start=\"3056\" data-end=\"3141\" class=\"\">Petrochemical Furnaces: Blanket linings, gaskets, and expansion joint insulation.<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"3142\" data-end=\"3225\" class=\"\"><p data-start=\"3144\" data-end=\"3225\" class=\"\">Glass Manufacturing: Roller insulation, furnace linings, and mold protection.<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"3226\" data-end=\"3337\" class=\"\"><p data-start=\"3228\" data-end=\"3337\" class=\"\">Battery &amp; Energy Storage: Sagger insulation in battery production, thermal containment for power systems.<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"3338\" data-end=\"3419\" class=\"\"><p data-start=\"3340\" data-end=\"3419\" class=\"\">Laser &amp; Plasma Cutting: Pipe and surface insulation from high heat sources.<\/p><\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-afd01ad e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"afd01ad\" data